| `ci_pipeline.adapters.<name>` | string | `github` is `.github/workflows/ci.yml`; `gitlab` is `.gitlab-ci.yml` | a repo-relative path of the file that CI service reads | `tests/ci_adapters.py`; `tests/integration/test_ci_pipeline_gate.py`, `tests/integration/test_copier_generation.py` | Names the file each CI adapter lives in; the gate judges each one present, and the copier answer `ci_pipeline` keeps exactly the chosen set, which `tests/integration/test_copier_generation.py` holds against copier.yml's `_exclude` and `_migrations`. Its keys are the answer's choices but `both`. | the steps an adapter runs: `ci_pipeline.steps` | always |
